      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "The draft excerpt is a strong, clear statement that reflects the urgency and necessity of UBI in the face of AI-driven labor displacement. It effectively communicates the economic imperative of transitioning to UBI to prevent systemic collapse and widespread insolvency. However, it could be strengthened by providing specific examples or data to support the claim that UBI is the only viable solution to the challenges posed by automation. This would help to solidify the argument and make it more persuasive for the Budget Committee hearings.",
      "source": "target",
